            <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 border border-brand-chocolate text-brand-chocolate text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-medium mb-4">{locale === 'cn' ? '专题' : 'FEATURED CATEGORY'}</span>
            <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light mb-3">{locale === 'cn' ? '羊绒打底裤与紧身裤' : 'Cashmere Leggings & Long Johns'}</h2>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
              {locale === 'cn'
                ? '羊绒打底裤、紧身裤、保暖长裤源头工厂直供。100% 内蒙古羊绒 14.5-15.5μm。适合贴身穿、保暖打底、家居休闲。可定制颜色、尺寸、logo。MOQ 50 件/款。'
                : 'Cashmere leggings, thermal pants, knit tights, and long johns direct from the Ordos spinning mill. 100% Inner Mongolian cashmere, 14.5-15.5μm fineness. Designed as base layers for warmth without bulk. Custom colors, sizes, and logo. MOQ 50 pcs per style.'}
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
            {leggings.slice(0, 8).map((p) => (
              <a
                href={`/${locale}/products/${p.id}/`}
                class="group block border border-border rounded-lg overflow-hidden hover:border-primary transition-colors bg-white"
              >
                <div class="aspect-square bg-secondary/30 overflow-hidden">
                  <img
                    src={resolveCategoryCardImage(p.images[0])}
                    alt={p.name}
                    class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform"
                    loading="lazy"
                  />
                </div>
                <div class="p-3">
                  <h3 class="text-xs font-medium leading-snug line-clamp-2 mb-1">{p.name}</h3>
                  <p class="text-[10px] text-muted-foreground">USD {p.price} · MOQ {p.moq} pcs</p>
                </div>
              </a>
            ))}
          </div>
          {leggings.length > 8 && (
            <p class="text-center text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-6">
              {locale === 'cn' ? `+ 还有 ${leggings.length - 8} 款，详见完整目录` : `+ ${leggings.length - 8} more styles, see full catalog below`}
            </p>
          )}
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-8 leading-relaxed">
            {locale === 'cn'
              ? '相关搜索：羊绒打底裤、羊绒紧身裤、羊绒保暖裤、羊绒长裤、cashmere leggings、cashmere tights、cashmere pants、cashmere long johns。'
              : 'Related searches: cashmere leggings, cashmere tights, cashmere pants, cashmere long johns, cashmere thermal underwear, cashmere base layer, cashmere trousers, cashmere knit pants, ladies cashmere leggings wholesale, thermal cashmere pants for women.'}
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    );
  })()}

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-background">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-light mb-8">{t.h1} — {products.length} styles</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        {products.map((p) => (
          <a
            href={`/${locale}/products/${p.id}/`}
